OL,3,GNEWSATories hold off Reform UK to win
OL,4,Aby-election
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives have held on to a
OL,7,Fseat on a tightly-balanced
OL,8,FLeicestershire council.
OL,10,FTory candidate Craig Smith got 55% of
OL,11,Fthe vote in the Long Whatton and
OL,12,FDiseworth by-election to be elected to
OL,13,FNorth West Leicestershire District
OL,14,FCouncil.
OL,16,FSmith will become part of a 19-strong
OL,17,Falliance of Tory, Liberal Democrat and
OL,18,Findependent councillors who run the
OL,19,Fauthority.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
